PRINCIPLE: Version numbers denote archival labels, not a count of demonstrated independent boots.
Five score axes match the main ledger: witnessed launch, attributable model response, Phext grounding, durable artifact, verified return. Each is 0, 0.5 or 1; zero means no admitted evidence unless a source documents failure. The arithmetic average is an audit/coverage index, not a sentience measure.
Scope: Phext CYOA snapshot 2026-04-12, Incipit snapshot 2026-04-12, user and assistant conversation history retrieved through 2026-11-02. Raw process logs and most original prompts unavailable.
V6-V10: explicitly retained as five missing-version slots, not fabricated from numbering.
V19: postscript draft beyond V1-V18, included to preserve the successor to V18 failure.
